 "_doc": "The cloud peak: a mountain three heights up, the clouds below it. Bare earth (0), the shelves (`raised`, 1), the high rock (`high`, 2) and the summit (`summit`, 3); `cloud` is the drop round the top, never walked, and a body shoved into it in a fight is gone. `ways_up` are the slopes.",
 "lure": "a summit three heights up with the clouds below it, and what the last climber left at the top",
 "story": {
  "end": "a climber cut the rope behind them, made the summit and scratched a name on it, and somebody who came up after wrote down how they left."
 },
